*   **convenience_feature_score**: Standard backup camera, keyless entry/start, remote start, adaptive cruise control, lane-keeping assist, available park assist, parking sensors (Source 5, 10, 11, 15, 20, 21, 23, 34). Good convenience features available. Positive score. Score: 0.70.
